# MODELS DIRECTORY MANIFESTO
# Standard: Model-Artifacts-v2.1

## Contents
- `house_regressor_final.joblib`: The production-ready XGBoost/RF model.
- `scaler.joblib`: The StandardScaling weights used during training.

## Policy
- Version control models using DVC (optional) or timestamps.
- Ensure model files are tracked if using LFS (Large File Storage).

